#       LBCB or LBCR. mjd_start inclusive, mjd_end exclusive; nan = open-ended.', Chips/channels without a matching row use the GAIN/RDNOISE
#       image headers., 'LBCB rows: published 2006 commissioning values (Giallongo et al. 2008, Table 1),', seeded until measured values
#       exist (LBCgo.detector.measure_gain_rdnoise_files)., 'LBCR: no published per-chip values; header values are used.']
# schema: astropy-2.0
channel chip gain rdnoise gain_flux mjd_start mjd_end source
